{
  "INTRODUCTION": [
    ["hey, need an essence runner?", "25 essence for {runes} {rune} runes and 25 notes{fare}.", "sounds good, where do i bring it?", "right here outside the ruins, i'll do the crafting."],
    ["you taking runners for {rune} runes?", "yep, {runes} runes and 25 notes for 25 essence{fare}.", "i can do that. unnoted essence, yeah?", "that's it. i'll wait here while you make the bank trip."],
    ["got room for another runner?", "sure. 25 essence gets {runes} runes and 25 notes{fare}.", "nice, i could use some {rune} runes.", "i get the crafting xp, you keep the payment."],
    ["hi, are you paying for essence runs?", "{runes} {rune} runes and 25 notes per 25 essence{fare}.", "alright, i'll bring it loose from the bank.", "good stuff. we can trade here by the ruins."],
    ["mind if i run some essence for you?", "go ahead. {runes} runes and 25 notes per load{fare}.", "25 essence each time?", "yep, unnoted. i'll handle the altar."],
