    ["what are you giving runners today?", "{runes} {rune} runes and 25 notes per load{fare}.", "i'll carry 25 essence a trip then.", "perfect. loose essence in, noted essence back."],
    ["can i help with the running?", "sure, {runes} runes and 25 notes for each 25 essence{fare}.", "i haven't done this much before.", "just unnote at a bank and bring it back here."],
    ["hey, still doing {rune} runs?", "yep. {runes} runes and 25 notes for 25 essence{fare}.", "good, i'll take a few trips.", "trade me outside the ruins when you're ready."],
